che de soja negra", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199158292051/", "num_games_owned": 2796, "num_reviews": 1711, "playtime_forever": 298, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 298, "last_played": 1754663826, "avatar": "d3eb39d70f297a4191bea908797cd7972a77ad86"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "ARS$ 164,99\t花里胡哨的 太乱了", "timestamp_created": 1754664035, "timestamp_updated": 1754664035, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201702727", "author": {"steamid": "76561198258246277", "personaname": "dear", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198258246277/", "num_games_owned": 200, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 27862, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17429, "last_played": 1775533679, "avatar": "b8f1c8ab5f3effbd5feada15b3a10eee04fd51e9"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "肥肠好玩的一款游戏\r\n\r\n其实深岩银河在2018年还没出之前我就已经加入了愿望单，但是拖拉至今才入库游玩。期间确实个人生活经历了很大的变化。但是如今玩到不得不说道说道整个游戏的完成度和反复游玩的意愿都拉满了。游戏性方面拥有着诸多任务以及生成地图，每一把都会有着不同的体验。探索体验方面无论是四个角色各自不同能力的个人英雄主义般的探索方法，还是钻机平台上种类繁多的装扮内容和枪械定制都有着无与伦比的体验。\r\n\r\n购买建议的话我认为只要是喜欢合作挑战或者是挖矿爱好的都可以无脑闭眼入，同时有着一个完整且愿意陪你走下去的队伍也是很关键的。当然野房里的大佬都很友好善良。如果要我说有什么必须记住的事情的话，记得在下矿之前请大家喝一杯昏迷黑啤就好。", "timestamp_created": 1754658397, "timestamp_updated": 1754658397, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201700131", "author": {"steamid": "76561199404518239", "personaname": "古明地小石(UᴗU)", "persona_s